{
  "_about": "The Tool registry. A Tool = something Ruri picks up on purpose to get an answer or do an action, and it returns a result. It does not fire by itself (that is a Feature) and it has no steps across turns (that is a Workflow). Map + rulings: system/INDEX.md section 'Tools'. retention: keep (rows) + regenerate (the usage block of each row, from a transcript scan).",
  "_installed_when": "a row here · the home exists · 'answers' names the question it is for · 'groups' names who may use it · 'state_scope' set · 'footprint' set · usage > 0 in the last scan (else status unused: wire it into a route or retire it)",
  "_usage_scan": {
    "date": "2026-10-06",
    "sessions": 357,
    "window": "2026-08-06 to 2026-10-06",
    "method": "tool calls counted in session transcripts; counts = sessions in which Ruri called it; a script a hook runs by itself is not counted",
    "status_rule": "live >= 10 sessions · rare 1-9 · unused 0"
